            "review_title": "Review at The KHANGS - Authentic Vietnamese Grill",
            "review_text": "John C\nPortsmouth, United Kingdom21 contributions\n0\nGreat little find\nAug 2024 • Family\nWe found this place by accident whilst checking out the city and it was amazing food and great prices, the place was not crowded and the food came out really quickly from great staff, I highly recommend, all of the family (6 adults) loved it.\nInsider tip:\nwe visited in the evening when it was fairly quiet, menu was available in English.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 30, 2025",
